{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00217",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 6.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Doctor? Hi. I hope I've got the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.92,
      "end_seconds": 12.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.18,
      "end_seconds": 21.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "Well, I've been having tingling in my fingers. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.93,
      "end_seconds": 30.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.43,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.61,
      "end_seconds": 45.09,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "It happens on and off. A seven out of ten, I suppose. Oh, and a weak grip. That's been about the same, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.89,
      "end_seconds": 52.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Have you had tingling in your fingers before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.23,
      "end_seconds": 60.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "I had a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.37,
      "end_seconds": 74.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "And what about headache or neck pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.3,
      "end_seconds": 79.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Oh, um, no, I'd have mentioned it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.5,
      "end_seconds": 87.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "And what about swelling in the joints or weakness in the legs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.67,
      "end_seconds": 90.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, I'd have mentioned it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.83,
      "end_seconds": 95.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Okay, keep going. And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.81,
      "end_seconds": 98.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.12,
      "end_seconds": 102.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "And what do you do for a living?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.73,
      "end_seconds": 106.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I work night shifts at a warehouse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.51,
      "end_seconds": 110.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Who's at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.31,
      "end_seconds": 117.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "It's just me and my wife at home now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.83,
      "end_seconds": 122.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Right, anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.11,
      "end_seconds": 126.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "My grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.38,
      "end_seconds": 131.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.13,
      "end_seconds": 136.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "I take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.89,
      "end_seconds": 140.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.71,
      "end_seconds": 147.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, I had a hernia repair, about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.71,
      "end_seconds": 153.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.73,
      "end_seconds": 157.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.76,
      "end_seconds": 176.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.59,
      "end_seconds": 184.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to latex, but I don't remember what reaction I had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.54,
      "end_seconds": 189.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.22,
      "end_seconds": 200.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Rest your hand here..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.9,
      "end_seconds": 238.21,
      "duration_seconds": 21.31,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 20.2, temp 36.9 degrees. And height 162 centimetres, blood pressure 121 over 71, respiratory rate 15, weight 53 kilos, pulse is 68 beats a minute. Listening to the whole story, I'd lean towards carpal tunnel syndrome. Diabetic neuropathy is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.42,
      "end_seconds": 245.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.98,
      "end_seconds": 257.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.5,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's carpal tunnel syndrome, and we'll know more once the a nerve conduction study is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.28,
      "end_seconds": 293.91,
      "duration_seconds": 23.63,
      "text": "I'll request a nerve conduction study, it'll help with hand numbness. Take short breaks from typing and keep the wrist straight. I think physiotherapy should see you too. I'd like you back after the results are back. Right, tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.05,
      "end_seconds": 301.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.31,
      "end_seconds": 306.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.62,
      "end_seconds": 311.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "All good here. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.56,
      "end_seconds": 314.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}